roduced: the receiver’s next `:stream-cursor` fails with `\\\"Invalid stream reference\\\"`. | Reject handoffs with unresolved resource dependencies before enqueueing, or serialize descriptors and explicitly reattach resources. Add a stream-creation-to-handoff regression test. |\\n| P2 | [continuation_handoff_v2.cljc:101](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/datomworld/demo/continuation_handoff_v2.cljc:101) | **Pure-data fidelity:** decoding treats any singleton primitive-marker map as executable identity. Reproduced: ordinary data `{:yin.continuation/primitive '+}` becomes a host function after transfer. | Use an unambiguous tagged encoding with escaping for ordinary data; test nested literal maps and actual primitive references. |\\n| P2, existing | [continuation_stream_v2.cljs:157](/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljs/datomworld/demo/continuation_stream_v2.cljs:157) | **No hidden global state:** the demo retains namespace-global mutable `app-state` and `run-raf-id`; drivers access them implicitly. This predates Phase 3 but prevents unconditional invariant approval. | Give each mounted composition explicit state and scheduling ownership, with host events deposited onto a stream. |\\n\\nProperties that passed:\\n\\n- REPL `:semantic` correctly uses `(linearize/ast-loader semantic/vm-load-program)` and supplies that loader to observer coordination.\\n- The semantic demo ships code datoms plus EDN register text through `enqueue-batch`; reception reconstructs a fresh VM from the batch. Its tested recursive program needs no off-stream continuation or live closure transfer.\\n- REPL and observer integration retain explicit session state and separate program observation from execution.\\n- Stream tests exercise make, cursor, next, put, close, blocked-read wakeup, backpressure retries, and terminal outcomes. FFI tests cover correlation, errors, and once-only handler execution.\\n\\n**Validation:** 69 JVM tests, 333 assertions passed across six suites. The two targeted probes above reproduced defects despite those passing tests. Browser/CLJS execution was not verified. No files were changed.\"}}\n.cpcache/1875258622.main\n.cpcache/2410757473.main\n.cpcache/4036708781.basis\n.cpcache/4107430544.cp\n.cpcache/4107430544.basis\n.cpcache/3936417337.basis\n.cpcache/785743703.basis\n.cpcache/4107430544.main\n.cpcache/2484545867.cp\n.cpcache/3644903311.main\n.cpcache/4036708781.cp\n.cpcache/1875258622.cp\n/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/java/21.0.2/bin/java\n/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/clojure/1.12.4.1602/bin/clj\n/Users/sto/.local/share/mise/installs/babashka/1.13.219/bb\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
